Description: Prepend meshy-dev downstream changelog entries.
 New source package version is 25.11.8-1meshy2 (matches
 ${SLURM_VERSION}-1${SLURM_DEB_PATCH_REV} with the SLURM_DEB_PATCH_REV
 Dockerfile ARG defaulting to meshy2). debuild emits .deb filenames
 stamped with this revision so produced artifacts are distinguishable
 from upstream SchedMD .debs. Regenerate this patch on every
 SLURM_VERSION bump: its context is the upstream changelog's first entry.
 Add a new entry, and bump SLURM_DEB_PATCH_REV, for each source change.
